/*
  SignalHistoryTable.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0269 · SignalHistoryTable (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SignalHistoryTable` resolves (table "SignalHistoryTable") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of strings the web source localizes
  (features/telemetry/components/SignalHistoryTable.tsx — its panel title, the four
  DataTable column headers, the header meta words, and the EmptyState title/message).
  The second group backs the Type-column badge labels (the web renders the raw
  `valueType` string verbatim; routed through the facade here so the native code holds
  no literal). The last group backs the native-only chrome (the P4 leaf freshness chip /
  banner, the error/retry state, and the accessibility labels) the Apple HIG states
  contract requires.
*/

